-- Kept on ASSUME deliberately (IMPLICIT-PROPS-DESIGN.md §11.1, R0: ASSUME is deprecated): l4 batch supplying a module-level ASSUME read through a helper is the thing under test.
§ `Helper reads an ASSUME`
ASSUME x IS A NUMBER
g MEANS x PLUS 1

@export f adds y to the helper's value
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
f y MEANS g PLUS y
